---
title: Chipotle Chicken Quinoa Burrito Bowl
description: Grilled chipotle-glazed chicken over quinoa with beans, avocado, salsa, and cheese.
source: https://www.eatingwell.com/recipe/254609/chipotle-chicken-quinoa-burrito-bowl/
author: EatingWell
servings: 4
time required: 30 minutes
course: main
cuisine: Mexican-inspired
tags:
  - chicken
